{"time": 1771249033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770010185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我是这个屋子里的食材老资历！曾见证了无数后辈努力成为美味的料理，实现食生价值”"}
{"time": 1771249043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587360207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我们这群食物还能拯救世界？难道这是什么美食番片场？”"}
{"time": 1771249050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195582830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“太有价值了”"}
{"time": 1771249062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68203737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“哇，还有老资历”"}
{"time": 1771249105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556336036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哇，还有老资历”"}
{"time": 1771249107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381093643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "圆大师背手回答：“后生仔，这你就不懂了吧。只有当所有食材都积极追求并实现自身的“美味价值”时，世间的餐桌才会充满幸福。而幸福的餐桌，便是和平世界最稳固的基石。”"}
{"time": 1771249126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35790074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1085207905", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=1E1068005688207F4337EB821A27ED11.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTS8HETlabzr30wfiU9TXJz9TwJpBitogUg_woowLLll5HekgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQCagA746dk1-m1zMeRgCG5noC21KCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMJWnUu5tT9dHN4MNghj_cfKIQe9AA90YyB2bO2a4Q5ff39Zkc3huTNpTyYc3nF2UBA,file_size=86317]"}
